Burntime Remastered 1.3 for AROS: origin, licences and credits
================================================================

Origin
------

This program is a port of Burntime Remastered by Jakob Harder
(https://github.com/jakobharder/burntime), rewritten in Rust for AROS by
Tomasz Staniak. It follows the remaster's version 1.3 (commit 550a1194). The
remaster is written in C# for .NET and MonoGame; its game rules, its readers
for the 1993 file formats and much of its interface were translated from that
source, and the translated modules name the C# files they come from.

This project is not affiliated with Max Design, with the original creators of
Burntime, or with the Burntime Remastered project.


